{"version":1,"content":"<p>據Anthropic的主承銷投行高盛的預測，Anthropic到2030年營收有望突破6000億美元，較去年營收增長超130倍。高盛向該筆IPO潛在投資者展示的預測模型顯示：公司今年總營收預計約520億美元，2027年增至1360億美元，2029年達到4420億美元，2030年進一步衝高至6000億美元以上。Anthropic 2025年營收為46億美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585838.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T17:24:28.519281+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T17:04:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T17:17:46.380544+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T17:17:46.380544+00:00","content_hash":"fce7c5257897b49596febe182fde3c06848f4b4296b108218b64f0450bcb9ded","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}